<html lang="vi"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width,initial-scale=1"><title>Giỏ hàng & thanh toán</title><link rel="stylesheet" href="/public/assets/css/site.css"><script src="https://cdn.tailwindcss.com"></script></head>
<body class="bg-background text-on-background"><main class="max-w-6xl mx-auto p-5 pt-10">
<a href="?page=products" class="text-primary">← Tiếp tục mua sắm</a><h1 class="text-3xl font-bold my-5">Giỏ hàng & thanh toán</h1>
